-----------------------
1                    
1 row selected.

$T0> AUTOCOMMIT OFF;
Set autocommit off success.
$T0> INSERT INTO NGD_NEG_SPDDL VALUES (21, 121, 221);
1 row inserted.
$T0> SAVEPOINT NGD_NEG_SP;
Savepoint success.
$T0> CREATE INDEX NGD_NEG_SPDDL_TRY ON NGD_NEG_SPDDL(V);
Create success.
$T0> ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT NGD_NEG_SP;
